  "operative_text": "Sec. 1 (RCW 9.41.129): (2) The department of licensing shall not keep copies or records of applications to purchase pistols provided for in RCW 9.41.090 or copies or records of pistol transfers provided for in RCW 9.41.110.  The department of licensing shall eliminate from any of its databases any copies or records of pistol purchase applications or pistol transfers maintained by the department of licensing."
